{"design":{"context":"视频在蓝衣男性完成举球、处于出手前临界点时暂停。游戏不追踪或修改视频人物，而是在暂停画面上叠加自绘的投篮训练面板。玩家通过按住与松开控制一个新增的模拟蓄力过程，观察自绘力量、举球高度和手腕角度，在绿色理想区内释放自绘篮球。视频人物、动作背景与原始画面均不参与数值判定，所有轨迹、控件和结果均为新增游戏设计。","goal":"在一次连续的按住蓄力操作中，于模拟最佳释放区间内松手，使自绘篮球稳定飞向自绘篮筐并命中目标。","screen":"透明背景的竖向游戏面板。顶部提示条显示“投篮出手”和当前状态；中部是自适应球场舞台，舞台右上方为自绘篮筐与目标圈，左下方为自绘篮球，底部显示操作提示。下方控制面板包含力量条、绿色理想区间标记、偏早/理想/偏晚标签、模拟举球高度、模拟手腕角度及结果说明。","input":"玩家在舞台按下鼠标左键或触屏开始蓄力；按住期间持续更新数值，松开时释放。统一使用 Pointer Events，并捕获活动指针，使拖出舞台后松手仍能完成一次释放。pointerup 只对活动指针生效；pointercancel 立即判定失败并结束。准备状态以外的重复按下、无效指针事件以及结束后的操作均被忽略。","rules":"第一次有效 pointerdown 的时间记为蓄力起点，松开时长 t 的有效范围为 0.85 秒至 1.15 秒，两个边界均计入成功区间。力量条按 t/1.25 秒映射到 0% 至 100%，超过 1.15 秒后保持在 100%。理想力量区间为 68% 至 92%。模拟举球高度等于 40% 加力量条的 60%，因此成功时为 80.8% 至 95.2%；模拟手腕角度等于 60 度加力量条的 35%，因此成功时为 83.8 度至 92.2 度。t<0.85 秒判定过早释放、力量不足；0.85≤t≤1.15 秒判定稳定出手并命中；t>1.15 秒判定出手过晚、手腕过度后仰。pointercancel 判定操作取消；8 秒内没有完成有效释放判定超时。每轮最多调用一次 api.finish。","states":"准备→蓄力→成功或失败→结束。准备状态显示“按住屏幕蓄力”；有效按下后进入蓄力状态并显示“保持按住，松开出手”；松开、pointercancel 或超时后进入对应结果状态并播放自绘篮球轨迹，同时仅调用一次 api.finish；销毁时清理指针监听、动画帧与计时器。","feedback":"成功时显示“力量适中，出手稳定！篮球命中目标！”，篮球沿高弧线飞向篮筐，目标圈变为绿色。过早释放时显示“力量不足，弧线偏低！”，篮球落到篮筐下方并显示黄色提示；过晚释放时显示“出手过晚，手腕过度后仰！”，篮球越过篮筐并显示红色提示；pointercancel 时显示“操作被取消：投篮失败”；超时时显示“未在时限内完成出手：投篮失败”。","timeout_s":8},"javascript":"function mount(container, api) {
  const root = document.createElement('div');
  root.className = 'game-root';
  root.setAttribute('role', 'application');
  root.setAttribute('aria-label', '蓄力投篮练习');
  container.appendChild(root);

  const header = document.createElement('div');
  header.className = 'game-header';
  const title = document.createElement('strong');
  title.textContent = '投篮出手';
  const status = document.createElement('span');
  status.textContent = '按住屏幕蓄力';
  header.appendChild(title);
  header.appendChild(status);

  const stage = document.createElement('div');
  stage.className = 'stage';
  stage.setAttribute('aria-label', '按住蓄力并在理想区间松开');

  const courtLine = document.createElement('div');
  courtLine.className = 'court-line';
  stage.appendChild(courtLine);

  const hoop = document.createElement('div');
  hoop.className = 'hoop';
  hoop.setAttribute('aria-label', '自绘篮筐目标');
  stage.appendChild(hoop);

  const ball = document.createElement('div');
  ball.className = 'ball';
  ball.setAttribute('aria-label', '自绘篮球');
  stage.appendChild(ball);

  const stageHint = document.createElement('div');
  stageHint.className = 'stage-hint';
  stageHint.textContent = '按住开始蓄力';
  stage.appendChild(stageHint);

  const panel = document.createElement('div');
  panel.className = 'control-panel';

  const meter = document.createElement('div');
  meter.className = 'meter';
  meter.setAttribute('aria-label', '蓄力力量与理想释放区间');
  const meterFill = document.createElement('div');
  meterFill.className = 'meter-fill';
  const idealBand = document.createElement('div');
  idealBand.className = 'ideal-band';
  idealBand.setAttribute('aria-label', '理想释放区间');
  meter.appendChild(meterFill);
  meter.appendChild(idealBand);

  const meterLabels = document.createElement('div');
  meterLabels.className = 'meter-labels';
  const earlyLabel = document.createElement('span');
  earlyLabel.textContent = '偏早';
  const idealLabel = document.createElement('span');
  idealLabel.textContent = '理想区';
  const lateLabel = document.createElement('span');
  lateLabel.textContent = '偏晚';
  meterLabels.appendChild(earlyLabel);
  meterLabels.appendChild(idealLabel);
  meterLabels.appendChild(lateLabel);

  const readouts = document.createElement('div');
  readouts.className = 'readouts';
  const heightReadout = document.createElement('div');
  heightReadout.className = 'readout';
  const heightName = document.createElement('span');
  heightName.textContent = '举球高度';
  const heightValue = document.createElement('b');
  heightValue.textContent = '40.0%';
  heightReadout.appendChild(heightName);
  heightReadout.appendChild(heightValue);
  const angleReadout = document.createElement('div');
  angleReadout.className = 'readout';
  const angleName = document.createElement('span');
  angleName.textContent = '手腕角度';
  const angleValue = document.createElement('b');
  angleValue.textContent = '60.0°';
  angleReadout.appendChild(angleName);
  angleReadout.appendChild(angleValue);
  readouts.appendChild(heightReadout);
  readouts.appendChild(angleReadout);

  const instruction = document.createElement('p');
  instruction.className = 'instruction';
  instruction.textContent = '力量进入绿色区域后松开即可稳定出手。';
  panel.appendChild(meter);
  panel.appendChild(meterLabels);
  panel.appendChild(readouts);
  panel.appendChild(instruction);

  root.appendChild(header);
  root.appendChild(stage);
  root.appendChild(panel);

  let state = 'prepare';
  let pointerId = null;
  let startedAt = 0;
  let animationFrame = 0;
  let timeoutTimer = 0;
  let finishCalled = false;
  let destroyed = false;

  function report(error) {
    if (api && typeof api.reportError === 'function') {
      api.reportError(String(error && error.message ? error.message : error));
    }
  }

  function setStatus(text) {
    status.textContent = text;
    stageHint.textContent = text;
  }

  function updateMeter(elapsed) {
    const power = Math.max(0, Math.min(100, elapsed / 1.25 * 100));
    const height = 40 + power * 0.60;
    const angle = 60 + power * 0.35;
    meterFill.style.width = power.toFixed(2) + '%';
    heightValue.textContent = height.toFixed(1) + '%';
    angleValue.textContent = angle.toFixed(1) + '°';
    meterFill.classList.toggle('in-ideal', power >= 68 && power <= 92);
  }

  function animate() {
    if (destroyed || state !== 'running') return;
    updateMeter((performance.now() - startedAt) / 1000);
    animationFrame = requestAnimationFrame(animate);
  }

  function finish(result, message, shotClass) {
    if (finishCalled || destroyed) return;
    finishCalled = true;
    state = result === 'success' ? 'success' : 'failure';
    pointerId = null;
    cancelAnimationFrame(animationFrame);
    setStatus(result === 'success' ? '投篮成功' : '投篮失败');
    instruction.textContent = message;
    if (shotClass) ball.classList.add(shotClass);
    if (result === 'success') hoop.classList.add('target-hit');
    try {
      if (!api || typeof api.finish !== 'function') {
        throw new Error('缺少 api.finish 方法');
      }
      api.finish({result: result, message: message});
    } catch (error) {
      report(error);
    }
  }

  function release(event) {
    if (state !== 'running' || pointerId === null || event.pointerId !== pointerId) return;
    event.preventDefault();
    const elapsed = (performance.now() - startedAt) / 1000;
    const releasedPointer = pointerId;
    pointerId = null;
    cancelAnimationFrame(animationFrame);
    updateMeter(elapsed);
    try {
      stage.releasePointerCapture(releasedPointer);
    } catch (error) {}
    if (elapsed < 0.85) {
      finish('failure', '力量不足，弧线偏低！', 'shot-early');
    } else if (elapsed > 1.15) {
      finish('failure', '出手过晚，手腕过度后仰！', 'shot-late');
    } else {
      finish('success', '力量适中，出手稳定！篮球命中目标！', 'shot-success');
    }
  }

  function cancel(event) {
    if (state !== 'running' || pointerId === null || event.pointerId !== pointerId) return;
    event.preventDefault();
    pointerId = null;
    cancelAnimationFrame(animationFrame);
    finish('failure', '操作被取消：投篮失败', 'shot-cancel');
  }

  function begin(event) {
    if (state !== 'prepare' || typeof event.pointerId !== 'number') return;
    if (event.pointerType === 'mouse' && event.button !== 0) return;
    event.preventDefault();
    pointerId = event.pointerId;
    state = 'running';
    startedAt = performance.now();
    setStatus('保持按住，松开出手');
    instruction.textContent = '蓄力中：力量进入绿色区域后松开。';
    updateMeter(0);
    try {
      stage.setPointerCapture(pointerId);
    } catch (error) {}
    animationFrame = requestAnimationFrame(animate);
  }

  function preventContextMenu(event) {
    event.preventDefault();
  }

  stage.addEventListener('pointerdown', begin);
  stage.addEventListener('pointerup', release);
  stage.addEventListener('pointercancel', cancel);
  stage.addEventListener('contextmenu', preventContextMenu);

  timeoutTimer = setTimeout(function timeout() {
    if (state === 'prepare' || state === 'running') {
      pointerId = null;
      cancelAnimationFrame(animationFrame);
      finish('failure', '未在时限内完成出手：投篮失败', 'shot-timeout');
    }
  }, 8000);

  function destroy() {
    if (destroyed) return;
    destroyed = true;
    clearTimeout(timeoutTimer);
    cancelAnimationFrame(animationFrame);
    stage.removeEventListener('pointerdown', begin);
    stage.removeEventListener('pointerup', release);
    stage.removeEventListener('pointercancel', cancel);
    stage.removeEventListener('contextmenu', preventContextMenu);
    if (root.parentNode) root.parentNode.removeChild(root);
  }

  return {destroy: destroy};
}","css":"#game {
  color: #f7fbff;
  background: transparent;
  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, sans-serif;
}
#game .game-root {
  width: min(100%, 520px);
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 12px;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  user-select: none;
  -webkit-user-select: none;
}
#game .game-header {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 12px;
  padding: 8px 12px;
  margin-bottom: 8px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18);
  border-radius: 12px;
  background: rgba(12,20,36,.72);
  box-sizing: border-box;
}
#game .game-header strong {
  font-size: 18px;
  letter-spacing: .04em;
}
#game .game-header span {
  color: #b9d8ff;
  font-size: 13px;
  text-align: right;
}
#game .stage {
  position: relative;
  height: clamp(220px, 58vw, 360px);
  overflow: hidden;
  border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2);
  border-radius: 18px;
  background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(38,74,125,.78), rgba(13,31,58,.86));
  box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,.04), 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,.2);
  touch-action: none;
  cursor: pointer;
}
#game .court-line {
  position: absolute;
  left: 8%;
  right: 8%;
  bottom: 17%;
  height: 2px;
  background: rgba(255,255,255,.38);
  transform: rotate(-4deg);
  transform-origin: center;
}
#game .court-line::before,
#game .court-line::after {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  bottom: 0;
  height: 54px;
  border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,.24);
  border-bottom: 0;
}
#game .court-line::before {
  left: 8%;
  width: 42%;
  border-right: 0;
  border-radius: 44px 0 0 0;
}
#game .court-line::after {
  right: 8%;
  width: 42%;
  border-left: 0;
  border-radius: 0 44px 0 0;
}
#game .hoop {
  position: absolute;
  top: 20%;
  right: 13%;
  width: 64px;
  height: 44px;
  border: 4px solid #f5a623;
  border-bottom: 0;
  border-radius: 38px 38px 0 0;
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(245,166,35,.16);
}
#game .hoop::before {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  left: 50%;
  bottom: -18px;
  width: 2px;
  height: 18px;
  background: #f5a623;
}
#game .hoop::after {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  left: 50%;
  bottom: -19px;
  width: 38px;
  height: 2px;
  background: #f5a623;
  transform: translateX(-50%);
}
#game .hoop.target-hit {
  border-color: #65e58a;
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 5px rgba(101,229,138,.24), 0 0 22px rgba(101,229,138,.8);
}
#game .ball {
  position: absolute;
  left: 13%;
  bottom: 13%;
  width: 28px;
  height: 28px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: radial-gradient(circle at 34% 30%, #ffb35c 0 18%, #e87922 19% 68%, #a74612 69%);
  box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.35), inset -4px -5px 0 rgba(114,43,8,.2);
  transform: translate(-50%, 50%);
  z-index: 2;
}
#game .ball::before,
#game .ball::after {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  left: 50%;
  top: 2px;
  width: 2px;
  height: 22px;
  border-radius: 2px;
  background: rgba(94,34,9,.7);
  transform: translateX(-50%);
}
#game .ball::after {
  transform: translateX(-50%) rotate(90deg);
}
#game .stage-hint {
  position: absolute;
  left: 50%;
  bottom: 7%;
  transform: translateX(-50%);
  padding: 7px 12px;
  border-radius: 999px;
  background: rgba(7,14,28,.58);
  color: #eaf4ff;
  font-size: 13px;
  white-space: nowrap;
  pointer-events: none;
}
#game .control-panel {
  margin-top: 8px;
  padding: 12px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18);
  border-radius: 14px;
  background: rgba(12,20,36,.72);
  box-sizing: border-box;
}
#game .meter {
  position: relative;
  height: 18px;
  overflow: hidden;
  border-radius: 999px;
  background: rgba(255,255,255,.14);
}
#game .meter-fill {
  position: absolute;
  left: 0;
  top: 0;
  bottom: 0;
  width: 0;
  border-radius: inherit;
  background: linear-gradient(90deg, #4f8dff, #ffd166 68%, #ff6b6b);
  transition: width .04s linear;
}
#game .meter-fill.in-ideal {
  background: linear-gradient(90deg, #4f8dff 0 67%, #65e58a 68% 92%, #ff6b6b 93%);
}
#game .ideal-band {
  position: absolute;
  left: 68%;
  top: 0;
  bottom: 0;
  width: 24%;
  border-left: 2px solid rgba(125,255,167,.95);
  border-right: 2px solid rgba(125,255,167,.95);
  background: rgba(76,230,123,.24);
  pointer-events: none;
}
#game .meter-labels {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  margin-top: 5px;
  color: #9eb4d0;
  font-size: 11px;
}
#game .meter-labels span:nth-child(2) {
  color: #8dffad;
}
#game .readouts {
  display: flex;
  gap: 10px;
  margin-top: 8px;
}
#game .readout {
  flex: 1;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 6px;
  padding: 8px 10px;
  border-radius: 9px;
  background: rgba(255,255,255,.08);
  font-size: 13px;
}
#game .readout b {
  color: #d8ecff;
}
#game .instruction {
  min-height: 18px;
  margin: 9px 2px 0;
  color: #d8e7f7;
  font-size: 13px;
  line-height: 1.4;
}
#game .ball.shot-success {
  animation: game-shot-success .75s cubic-bezier(.2,.75,.25,1) forwards;
}
#game .ball.shot-early {
  animation: game-shot-early .7s ease-out forwards;
}
#game .ball.shot-late {
  animation: game-shot-late .75s ease-out forwards;
}
#game .ball.shot-cancel,
#game .ball.shot-timeout {
  animation: game-shot-stop .45s ease-out forwards;
}
@keyframes game-shot-success {
  0% { left: 13%; top: 76%; transform: translate(-50%, 50%) rotate(0deg); }
  55% { left: 48%; top: 28%; transform: translate(-50%, 50%) rotate(360deg); }
  78% { left: 70%; top: 38%; transform: translate(-50%, 50%) rotate(540deg); }
  100% { left: 84%; top: 27%; transform: translate(-50%, 50%) rotate(720deg); }
}
@keyframes game-shot-early {
  0% { left: 13%; top: 76%; transform: translate(-50%, 50%) rotate(0deg); }
  55% { left: 35%; top: 43%; transform: translate(-50%, 50%) rotate(220deg); }
  100% { left: 57%; top: 76%; transform: translate(-50%, 50%) rotate(380deg); }
}
@keyframes game-shot-late {
  0% { left: 13%; top: 76%; transform: translate(-50%, 50%) rotate(0deg); }
  55% { left: 52%; top: 26%; transform: translate(-50%, 50%) rotate(260deg); }
  78% { left: 80%; top: 18%; transform: translate(-50%, 50%) rotate(470deg); }
  100% { left: 96%; top: 34%; transform: translate(-50%, 50%) rotate(650deg); }
}
@keyframes game-shot-stop {
  0% { left: 13%; top: 76%; transform: translate(-50%, 50%) rotate(0deg); }
  100% { left: 22%; top: 69%; transform: translate(-50%, 50%) rotate(80deg); }
}
@media (max-width: 360px) {
  #game .game-root { padding: 8px; }
  #game .game-header { padding: 7px 9px; }
  #game .game-header strong { font-size: 16px; }
  #game .readout { font-size: 12px; padding: 7px; }
}"}

